[~piccolbo] & [~shivaram] Thanks for the comments. Are we considering  to  get the dependence of every function? By doing so, we can possibly solve the issue of side effect. But we may risk serializing more data associate with the function, since multiple pipelined functions may share some common free variables. I personally think the latter issue is minor, compared to the side effect, and can also be probably solved.

